  "characterDescription": "A precision-engineered fixed navigation with an expressive mix-blend-mode difference subnav that inverts against page content, paired with an elastic cubic-bezier easing signature that gives motion a snappy, high-end mechanical quality. The system favors restrained opacity-based link states over decorative underlines, communicating confidence through subtraction."
